  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize winning the Jack and Nine of trumps (The 'Jass' and 'Manille' equivalents). Count the 24 cards carefully to identify when it is safe to lead point-heavy cards like Aces and Tens.\n\nUse your 'Dad' or 'Fifty' sequences to force opponents into a set. Manage your trumps to ensure you win the last trick (10 pts) and secure the win.\n\nDefensive play: If you are the opponents, focus on 'hicking' the bidders by forcing them to use their high trumps on low-value tricks, then taking the point-heavy late cards.",
    Player: "Prioritize winning the Jack and Nine of trumps (The 'Jass' and 'Manille' equivalents). Count the 24 cards carefully to identify when it is safe to lead point-heavy cards like Aces and Tens.\n\nUse your 'Dad' or 'Fifty' sequences to force opponents into a set. Manage your trumps to ensure you win the last trick (10 pts) and secure the win.\n\nDefensive play: If you are the opponents, focus on 'hicking' the bidders by forcing them to use their high trumps on low-value tricks, then taking the point-heavy late cards.",
